.TH DCM-CMP 1 2026-06-12 "libdicom @DCM_SUFFIXED_VERSION@" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
dcm-cmp \- print metadata content of two provided DICOM PS3.10 files to standard output with ascii highlighting to show differences

.SH SYNOPSIS
.BR "dcm-dcmp " [ -hViwcl "]
.IR file

.SH DESCRIPTION
Print metadata content of DICOM PS3.10 file to standard output.

.SH OPTIONS

.TP
.B -h
Display help message (usage summary) and exit.

.TP
.B -V
Display version and exit.

.TP
.B -i
Show info messages.

.TP
.B -w
Show warning messages.

.TP
.B -c
Do not display colored output.

.TP
.B -l
Display full image metadata rather than subset.

.SH EXIT STATUS
.B dcm-dump
returns 0 on success, 1 if a file could not be read or 2 if the
arguments are invalid.
